"entity": {
"name": "Snam S.p.A.",
"description": "SNAM SpA engages in the gas infrastructure and energy transition business. It operates through the Transportation, Storage, Regasification, Energy Transition, and Other segments. The Transportation segment refers to natural gas transportation and dispatching activities in Italy. The Storage segment provides natural gas storage services in Italy. The Regasification segment provides liquefied natural gas regasification services. The Energy Transition segment includes companies operating in the energy sector through the legal entities of the Renovit Group, as well as companies involved in the biogas and biomethane business through the legal entities of the Bioenerys Group. The Other segment includes sustainable mobility businesses. The company was founded on October 30, 1941 and is headquartered in San Donato Milanese, Italy.",
